commit.  Then add one exact source runner, a source pin, and an independent
static attack.

On a green exact run, add:

- a short bounded theorem note;
- a content-bound runner cache;
- execution history with wall time and hashes;
- a postexecution panel/portfolio return; and
- an explicit zero-movement TOE update.

